{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9a112ae4e801383ac40ab5fe909e410695145a1e5bdd9e467feca791bf199a95", "ja": "死んだ同僚と同じ顔をした＜ハーマン＞に\n驚くスタークス。アンジーの死の真相を突き\n止めるため、ハーマンの話に乗る事に。だが\n任務の協力者は監獄の凶悪犯罪者達な上、\nリーダーを任され、先行きに不安を覚える。", "zh": "惊讶地发现＜哈曼＞竟然长着与已故同僚一模一样的脸，斯塔克斯为了查明安吉死亡的真相，决定顺着哈曼的话行动。然而，任务的协助者不仅是监狱里的重罪犯，还要由他担任领队，这让他对前途感到不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "6bbdbffe774b7956911c510336e9228742714d3430e14dac92cb32ccc6060ba0", "ja": "アンジー、生きていたのか！　よかった……！", "zh": "安吉，你还活着啊！太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bfc8a0ad489bfdc250c2418c7eac217c81ab6b85a4b0902c72e12e3a472d5b86", "ja": "アンジー……死んだ貴方の同僚刑事ですね。\n面識はありませんが、私によく似ているとか。", "zh": "安吉……就是那位已经去世的刑警同事吧。\n虽然我和他并不认识，但听说我和他很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "0a2ae2496fe08e83b67124e6191fbeb926a115f8748880a4efabc99ef8325548", "ja": "えっ？\nあんた……アンジーじゃないのか？", "zh": "咦？\n你……不是安吉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5ff19db6a05636dbfc1ebf0fa197b9e2ff846bb85e1050c2ff9f9bf0de8eef7d", "ja": "私の名は、アレックス・ハーマン。\n内閣府の者です。", "zh": "我是亚历克斯·赫尔曼。内阁府的工作人员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "24b1e4a6d4efb1d607cc613590cfea07b3dd960ee26ca6b7b777173f3c295428", "ja": "時間がないので、手短に用件を。そのアンジーを\n殺した真犯人を突き止めるため、力を貸してほしい。", "zh": "时间紧迫，长话短说。我希望你能帮我找出杀害安吉的真凶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "14c9951144e64bcda3f4112fd36c568cec76910c15252b8618f2f13b4811c033", "ja": "内閣府の人間って……つまり政府の高官だろ？\nそれがなんで、アンジーの事を……？", "zh": "内阁府的人……也就是说，是政府高官吧？  \n那他为什么会对安琪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f7cd3b534798ba4badc1a3333e97fd4386cf9d2aa04c9009c3ea41dc512763bb", "ja": "貴方の同僚であるアンジーは、ある秘密を\n知ったため、何者かに消された可能性があります。", "zh": "作为您的同事，安琪可能因为知道了某个秘密，而被某人灭口了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "550f6a304f98f1b8b0ee221ac600fc00f0848a7d7767ccb02b70bf2c496e1ff4", "ja": "我々は、その秘密を追っている最中です。\n鍵は、彼女が残した手帳にありました。", "zh": "我们正在追查那个秘密。\n关键就在她留下的手册里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508", "ja": "これは……。", "zh": "这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d012304af23fb6010b820535505ec81fb5eb026e9236fd331cb684ba0d3b7e38", "ja": "貴方も知っている名前だと思いますが。", "zh": "我想，这也是你知道的名字。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "11be8ea445e902f821f7c425837c7f463e41ac19a50f015a03239c401085bd2a", "ja": "知っているも何も、錚々たるメンツだ。現役の官僚に\n政治団体、おまけに宗教団体とマフィアまで……？", "zh": "这些名字我当然知道，全都是大人物。现役官僚、政治团体，还有宗教团体和黑手党……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "59751e11c687a914406ef39319e07d9d80ba662eb0166a0b7161d18184081a95", "ja": "ここにいる連中と、深い繋がりがある奴ばかり……\nどうなってるんだ？", "zh": "全都是和这里这些人有着深厚关系的家伙……  \n这到底是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3a0ad4d0fdd43eb4dbc2115b5db08b55d9080c02eeca9d5edbeeee56c38c7909", "ja": "覚えましたね？　……貴方には、アンジーが\n知った秘密を、突き止めて欲しいのです。", "zh": "记住了吗？……我希望您能替我查清楚，安吉所知晓的那个秘密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a3144ae86987ad3d4b2cfd3d56896136c9a1d59ca23a019c1d37a588f143a299", "ja": "成功した暁には、監獄からの釈放。そして報酬金。\nこの国を出て行きたいなら、その手続きも可能です。", "zh": "成功之后，你就能获释出狱，还能拿到报酬金。\n如果你想离开这个国家，我们也可以帮你办理相关手续。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "6e81724eb5566c35b7f812cc702622d3d441494b6d3061f920304c7bfd016f15", "ja": "随分、勝手だな。裁判では、冤罪だって俺の主張を\n握り潰しておいて……今度は協力しろだって？", "zh": "真是够随心所欲的啊。在审判时明明把我主张自己是冤罪的说法都压下去了……现在又要我来协助你们？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "30ec01f2bd107b97ef26a05093ccbf7e2eb0936e78407222ab226b21ddd26f4b", "ja": "互いの利益になると考えての提案です。それに貴方は、\n他の誰より、真犯人を捕まえたいと思っているのでは？", "zh": "这是出于对彼此都有利的考虑而提出的建议。而且，你不是比任何人都更想抓住真凶吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ea6e231a1b388a713627983020011ecbb5204d8285684f87ca04f0f6140d2c6", "ja": "……わかった。\nその話、乗ってやる。", "zh": "……我知道了。\n这件事，我答应你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "52196ff844caafca0eac2fbe1ca1c7b6047844b0ba5a6ee9dd6f0520fbfae2b9", "ja": "ありがとうございます。では早速、任務に\n就くにあたって、彼らを連れていってください。", "zh": "谢谢。那么事不宜迟，开始执行任务时，请把他们带上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1018_se", "source_sha256": "d875dd1e72f815d4037f140c9d9cb85d4989db4c78f444f20bb1883835e22ea9", "ja": "ウィーン……ガシャン！", "zh": "嗡……咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "f55e013f6d454f0d196cf82a1d20807a6ddaefb8e2211b77faab4329513b2620", "ja": "……はぁっ！？　な、なんでこいつらと！？", "zh": "……哈啊！？为、为什么要和这帮家伙一起！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "88b59e046ecf651b2310a13394baeed241057c58b3fc0e97533a74d9a090655c", "ja": "彼らにも、貴方と同じ条件で協力を依頼しました。\n今回の事件を解決するには、必要不可欠な存在です。", "zh": "我也以和您相同的条件，请求他们协助。要解决这起事件，他们是不可或缺的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "01bfe7091c3ed0be6202200e29024f8759f4ee7c434c2a252e43da59577ca8c7", "ja": "正気か！？\nこいつらは、第一級の凶悪犯罪者だぞ！？", "zh": "你疯了吗！？\n这些人可是一级重罪犯啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "eb298b66f0b452b70776b0351ff44b74049528ab1862977a2f38c65a4a811139", "ja": "スタークスくん、ひど～い……。ていうか、\n凶悪犯罪者なのはお互い様じゃないの～……？", "zh": "斯塔克斯，你好过分～……。话说回来，既然是凶恶罪犯，不是彼此彼此吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "c98cdd3f8a09a640269ce691910e12ea1834495b6173e7fd0c0fc0a329db7641", "ja": "その言い方は、些か不本意ですね。\n私を貴方がたと一緒にしないでいただきたい。", "zh": "这种说法，实在让我有些不快。还请不要把我和你们相提并论。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "8a6f0b296ace55acb0f83a184c148e5df047d300da49260d2dce816ce5afef73", "ja": "同感だ。それに、こんな大所帯で進めるとは初耳だぞ、\nハーマン。僕はてっきり、単独行動だと思っていたが？", "zh": "我也有同感。而且，要这么大阵仗一起行动的事我还是第一次听说啊，\n赫尔曼。我原本还以为是单独行动呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "16abda2a1d25a28f8ec16c78b10e15b85c98b5ddf29516f21f07b22352183345", "ja": "資料を見たでしょう、スタークス。彼らの名前も、\nアンジーの手帳にあった……。", "zh": "你看过资料了吧，斯塔克斯。他们的名字也在安琪的记事本上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ae5229cd6933ed0d743fe2dc59d6e04cacf8d763c9086fc85944ae77f179df95", "ja": "その服は私達政府の人間と同じものですが、\n首元には枷があります。意味はわかりますね？", "zh": "那身衣服和我们政府人员穿的一样，不过脖子上戴着枷锁。意思你明白吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "093a55dce0a94fc45fb48f3c4c19b24b06fd6868e79b66d26a23adfd5b7c770f", "ja": "貴方達の行動は、通信衛星で監視されています。\nその枷を外そうなどとは、考えないように。", "zh": "你们的一举一动都在通信卫星的监视之下。别想着把那副枷锁取下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0daf1c53bb29680a52e7ddd37fe6d4e0a388776b6f3c6eb246c3bee6aaad1d7d", "ja": "では、以降はリーダーの指示に従ってください。\n早急な真相の解明、期待しています。", "zh": "那么，接下来请听从队长的指示。\n期待你们尽快查明真相。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1030_se", "source_sha256": "d875dd1e72f815d4037f140c9d9cb85d4989db4c78f444f20bb1883835e22ea9", "ja": "ウィーン……ガシャン！", "zh": "嗡……咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1031_003mik", "source_sha256": "c350036e5cd34a1a64ec1950846002e035309f97c82015ee2c29117d983094e3", "ja": "リーダー？\nリーダーって………………もしかして、俺か！？", "zh": "队长？\n队长是………………该不会，是我吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "07ef0482eea2470f84ecff85877f7c7e000b732f25db0c1518c07670188730aa", "ja": "どうやらそのようですね。\nよろしくお願いします、リーダー。ふふっ。", "zh": "看来确实是这样。\n请多关照，队长。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "0bb8a68a4070e2d8e0a2ceafc7692b3ad7ea5538cc3a1e34da17405df18f448f", "ja": "せいぜい、言われた仕事をこなすんだな。\nただし、こちらの邪魔だけはするなよ。", "zh": "你只管把交代给你的工作做好。不过，可别妨碍我们这边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0243_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0243_story_02_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "f56ad1ac2918f120a89dcd5e1e3f16a28ed87077f1241ab4c55c831e39a1abca", "ja": "ふふ、外か……久し振りだなぁ……♪", "zh": "呵呵，外面啊……真是好久没来了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
